# The modern pad in AC3P's menus: probe-mission.pad's route to the first sortie with
# every cross tap sent as the modern pad's A (carrier 0x00000400) and every circle
# tap as its B (0x00000800). Under dual, where the gamepad layout is modern, the
# PSP converter's replacement must turn them back into cross and circle outside
# play, or the route never leaves the title screen. Then a short walk, to show
# the sortie was reached.


drain 1500
minhold 4

  @100 tap start
  @200 tap 0x00000800
  @300 tap 0x00000400
  @400 tap start
  @500 tap 0x00000800
  @600 tap 0x00000400
  @700 tap start
  @800 tap 0x00000800
  @900 tap 0x00000400
  @1000 tap start
  @1100 tap 0x00000800
  @1200 tap 0x00000400
  @1300 tap start
  @1400 tap 0x00000800
  @1500 tap 0x00000400
  @1600 tap start
  @1700 tap 0x00000800
  @1800 tap 0x00000400
  @1900 tap start
  @2000 tap 0x00000800
  @2100 tap 0x00000400
  @2200 tap start
  @2300 tap 0x00000800
  @2400 tap 0x00000400
  @2500 tap start
  @2600 tap 0x00000800
  @2700 tap 0x00000400
  @2800 tap start
  @2900 tap 0x00000800
  mark "leave the option screen"
  @3000 tap 0x00000800
  @3080 tap 0x00000800
  @3160 tap down
  @3190 tap down
  @3220 tap down
  @3250 tap down
  @3280 tap down
  @3310 tap down
  @3360 tap 0x00000400
  mark "confirm onwards"
  @3440 tap 0x00000400
  @3520 tap 0x00000400
  @3600 tap 0x00000400
  @3680 tap 0x00000400
  @3760 tap 0x00000400
  @3840 tap 0x00000400
  @3920 tap 0x00000400
  @4000 tap 0x00000800
  @4080 tap 0x00000400
  @4160 tap 0x00000400
  @4240 tap 0x00000400
  @4320 tap 0x00000400
  @4400 tap 0x00000400
  @4480 tap 0x00000400
  @4560 tap 0x00000400
  @4640 tap 0x00000400
  @4720 tap 0x00000400
  @4800 tap 0x00000400
  @4880 tap 0x00000400
  @4960 tap 0x00000400
  @5040 tap 0x00000400
  @5120 tap 0x00000400
  @5200 tap 0x00000400
  @5280 tap 0x00000400
  @5360 tap 0x00000400
  @5440 tap 0x00000400
  @5520 tap 0x00000400
  @5600 tap 0x00000400
  @5680 tap 0x00000400
  @5760 tap 0x00000400
  @5840 tap 0x00000400
  @5920 tap 0x00000400
  @6000 tap 0x00000800
  @6080 tap 0x00000400
  @6160 tap 0x00000400
  @6240 tap 0x00000400
  @6320 tap 0x00000400
  @6400 tap 0x00000400
  @6480 tap 0x00000400
  @6560 tap 0x00000400
  @6640 tap 0x00000400
  @6720 tap 0x00000400
  @6800 tap 0x00000400
  @6880 tap 0x00000400
  @6960 tap 0x00000400
  @7040 tap 0x00000400
  @7120 tap 0x00000400
  @7200 tap 0x00000400
  @7280 tap 0x00000400
  @7360 tap 0x00000400
  mark "walk forward, full stick"
  mark "walk forward"
  @7600 analog 128 8
  @7700 analog 128 128
  @7800 stop
